---
/**
 * Reduction3D: a hardness reduction executed in 3D. Pick a bin packing instance, pack it (drag and
 * drop, or let the solver do it), and the string of the proof folds into a perfect cube step by step.
 *
 *   <div class="full"><Reduction3D /></div>
 *     Berger and Leighton: S_B folded as in §3.2.3, the packing on the front face
 *   <div class="full"><Reduction3D construction="edge" /></div>
 *     the short version of the one-edge construction: S folded, the packing on one edge
 *
 * Left, one panel: the instance (folded away), the packing board, the formula of S_B, the checks.
 * The board has the bin-packing game's look: it uses the game's bp- classes and styles
 * (../bin-pack/styles.css) and its controls (drag, or click an item and then a bin; keys 1–K, 0).
 * Right: the three.js stage (day or night) with a dock: the step, ◀ ▶, and the whole string as a
 * bar with an arrow at the current letter, which can be dragged. "Explain" opens the rest.
 * Logic: reduction.client.js (UI, rendering), with adapter-bl.js / adapter-edge.js for what belongs
 * to one construction, and construction.js / edge-construction.js (the strings and the folds; they
 * also run in Node, and in the browser in a worker, build.worker.js).
 * Styles: styles.css (ids and classes prefixed rd-). One widget per page (the ids are fixed).
 */
import '../bin-pack/styles.css';
import './styles.css';
import { withBase } from '../../lib/url';

interface Props {
  construction?: 'bl' | 'edge';
}
const { construction = 'bl' } = Astro.props;
const edge = construction === 'edge';
const cards = withBase('/original-proof/');
const str = edge ? 'S' : 'S_B';
---

<div class="rd-root ui" data-construction={construction} data-cards={cards} data-stage="day" data-explain="0">
  <aside class="rd-left" aria-label="Instance, packing and string">
    <details class="rd-sec rd-fold rd-inst">
      <summary><span class="rd-h">Instance</span> <span id="rd-instSum" class="rd-sum"></span></summary>
      <div class="rd-foldbody">
        <label class="rd-fld"><span>Preset</span><select id="rd-preset"></select></label>
        <div class="rd-row2">
          <label class="rd-fld"><span>{edge ? 'm (bins)' : 'K (bins)'}</span><input id="rd-inK" type="number" min="1" max={edge ? 5 : 3} step="1" /></label>
          <label class="rd-fld"><span>B (bin size)</span><input id="rd-inB" type="number" min="1" step="1" /></label>
        </div>
        <label class="rd-fld"><span>{edge ? 'Item sizes, adding up to m·B' : 'Item sizes, adding up to B·K'}</span><input id="rd-inS" type="text" spellcheck="false" /></label>
      </div>
    </details>

    <section class="rd-sec rd-pack" aria-labelledby="rd-packTitle">
      <h3 class="rd-head"><span class="rd-h" id="rd-packTitle">Pack the bins</span> <span id="rd-packHint" class="rd-packhint"></span></h3>
      <div id="rd-board" class="rd-board"></div>
      <div class="rd-btnrow">
        <button class="btn" id="rd-tReset" type="button">Empty the bins</button>
        <button class="btn" id="rd-tSolve" type="button">Solve it for me</button>
      </div>
      <p id="rd-solveinfo" class="rd-note"></p>
      <button id="rd-find" class="btn primary rd-primary" type="button">Fold the string</button>
      <p id="rd-status" class="rd-status" role="status"></p>
    </section>

    <section class="rd-sec rd-str" aria-labelledby="rd-strTitle">
      <h3 class="rd-head"><span class="rd-h" id="rd-strTitle">{edge ? <Fragment>The string <i>S</i></Fragment> : <Fragment>The string <i>S</i><sub>B</sub> (Fig. 3)</Fragment>}</span> <button class="rd-tog" id="rd-fmtTog" type="button">show numbers</button></h3>
      <div id="rd-formula"></div>
    </section>

    <details class="rd-sec rd-fold rd-checks">
      <summary><span class="rd-h">Checks of the fold</span> <span id="rd-checkSum"></span></summary>
      <div id="rd-checks"><div class="check"><small>Fold the string to build and check the fold.</small></div></div>
    </details>
  </aside>

  <div class="rd-stage" role="group" aria-label="3D view of the fold">
    <div id="rd-gl"></div>
    <div id="rd-placeholder" class="rd-placeholder">
      <div>Pack the bins on the left, or let the solver do it, and press <b>Fold the string</b>.<br />{edge ? <i>S</i> : <Fragment>S<sub>B</sub></Fragment>} appears as a straight chain; <b>→</b> then folds it one step at a time.</div>
    </div>
    <div id="rd-hud" hidden>
      <div class="box" id="rd-stats"></div>
      <div class="rd-hudright">
        <div class="box rd-legend" aria-label="Legend">
          <span><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="15" height="15" aria-hidden="true"><circle id="rd-lgH" cx="8" cy="8" r="7" /></svg>H</span>
          <span><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="15" height="15" aria-hidden="true"><circle id="rd-lgP" cx="8" cy="8" r="3.6" /></svg>P</span>
        </div>
        <button class="box rd-iconbtn" id="rd-stageBtn" type="button" title="Night view" aria-label="Night view">☾</button>
      <div class="rd-viewmenu">
        <button class="box" id="rd-viewBtn" type="button" aria-controls="rd-toggles">View ▾</button>
        <div class="box" id="rd-toggles" hidden>
          <label><input type="checkbox" id="rd-tgP" checked /> P's</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox" id="rd-tgBond" checked /> chain</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox" id="rd-tgHP" checked /> H/P colours (H red, P faint)</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox" id="rd-tgCut" /> cut a corner away</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox" id="rd-tgLab" checked /> {edge ? 'bin labels' : 'strip labels'}</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox" id="rd-tgCam" /> move the camera with each step</label>
        </div>
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="rd-zoom" id="rd-zoom" hidden>
      <button id="rd-zoomIn" type="button" title="Zoom in (+)" aria-label="Zoom in">+</button>
      <button id="rd-zoomOut" type="button" title="Zoom out (−)" aria-label="Zoom out">−</button>
    </div>
    <div id="rd-dock" hidden>
      <div id="rd-timeline" aria-label="Steps"></div>
      <div id="rd-stepinfo">
        <div id="rd-stepTag"></div>
        <div class="rd-titlerow">
          <div id="rd-stepTitle"></div>
          <button id="rd-explain" class="rd-explain" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Explain</button>
        </div>
        <div id="rd-hint" hidden>Press <kbd>→</kbd> or <b>▶</b> to fold the next piece.</div>
        <div id="rd-stepRes"></div>
        <div id="rd-stepBody"></div>
      </div>
      <div id="rd-scrub">
        <button id="rd-bPrev" type="button" title="Back one step (←)" aria-label="Back one step">◀</button>
        <div id="rd-bar" role="slider" tabindex="0" aria-label={`Position in the string ${str}`} aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="0" aria-valuenow="0">
          <canvas id="rd-barCv"></canvas>
          <div id="rd-marker" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div id="rd-barTip" hidden></div>
        </div>
        <button id="rd-bNext" type="button" title="Fold the next step (→)" aria-label="Next step">▶</button>
      </div>
      <div id="rd-controls">
        <span class="kbd">→ next step · ← back · drag the string to jump · drag the cube to turn · + − zoom</span>
        <div class="sp">speed <input id="rd-speed" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50" aria-label="Speed" /> <span id="rd-speedLbl">1.0×</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  // three.js and the construction come in their own chunk, loaded once the page is up
  const roots = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.rd-root');
  if (roots.length) {
    import('./reduction.client.js').then(({ mount }) => roots.forEach((el) => mount(el)));
  }
</script>
